/**
 * @packages/ztan-witness
 * 
 * ZTAN Witness Long-Duration Soak & Multi-Process Contention Test Harness.
 * Directly addresses the Strategic SRE Priorities:
 * 1. Long-duration soak testing (append storms under stress).
