            </tr>
          \`;
        }

        panel.innerHTML = \`
          <h3>🔬 Intra-Host Repeatability under Campaign-Scoped Constraints <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: normal;">CV (σ/μ) across identical campaign runs</span></h3>
